WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.023 --> 00:00:10.017
Open Appearance from More.

2
00:00:10.017 --> 00:00:14.028
Choose an accent color and check the preview.

3
00:00:14.028 --> 00:00:24.373
Use Custom Color to choose another color.

4
00:00:24.373 --> 00:00:44.418
Choose a color or photo for the chat background. Start with a color.

5
00:00:44.418 --> 00:00:57.932
Switch between Light and Dark to preview the background.

6
00:00:57.932 --> 00:01:14.000
To use a photo, choose it from Photos.

7
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Pinch to resize, drag to reposition, then tap Done.

8
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:37.000
Adjust the opacity and save to apply it to the chat screen.

9
00:01:37.000 --> 00:02:05.367
Appearance syncing in iCloud starts turned off.
